<Base title="Privacy — Plinth" path="/legal/privacy">
  <p class="land-band">Privacy</p>
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <article class="plot-window prose">
    <p>Plinth stores form submissions, webhook payloads, and usage counters needed to operate the service. IP addresses are hashed. Authorization headers in Catch are redacted.</p>
    <p>Payments are processed by Polar (merchant of record). We do not store card numbers.</p>
    <p>Contact: <a href="mailto:support@plinthrun.com">support@plinthrun.com</a></p>
    <p>This is a starter policy for launch; replace with counsel-reviewed text before large volume.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
